  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.transaction\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a> delegating to the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.transaction 中的类\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a>，该管理器委托给指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction 中的类或接口\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "As consequence, a transaction can get into a state, where the first <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> has committed\nits transaction and a subsequent <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> failed to commit its transaction (e.g. caused by\nan I/O error or the transactional resource failed to commit for other reasons). In that case,\n<a href=\"#commit(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionStatus)\"><code>commit(TransactionStatus)</code></a> throws a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/HeuristicCompletionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>HeuristicCompletionException</code></a> to indicate a partially committed\ntransaction. Rollback isn't affected as the natural consequence of a missing commit is a rollback of a transactional\nresource. <a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.transaction\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a> should be only used if the application can tolerate or recover from\ninconsistent state caused by partially committed transactions. In any other case, the use of\n<a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.transaction\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a> is not recommended.",
      "translation": "因此，事务可能进入一种状态：第一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction 中的类或接口\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 已提交其事务，而随后的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction 中的类或接口\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 未能提交其事务（例如，由 I/O 错误引起，或因其他原因导致事务性资源无法提交）。在这种情况下，<a href=\"#commit(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionStatus)\"><code>commit(TransactionStatus)</code></a> 会抛出一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/HeuristicCompletionException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction 中的类或接口\"><code>HeuristicCompletionException</code></a>，以指示事务已部分提交。回滚不受影响，因为缺少提交的自然后果是事务性资源被回滚。<a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.transaction 中的类\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a> 仅应在应用程序能够容忍或从部分提交事务导致的不一致状态中恢复时才使用。在任何其他情况下，不建议使用 <a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.transaction 中的类\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The configured instances will start transactions in the order given and commit/rollback in <em>reverse</em> order,\nwhich means the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> most likely to break the transaction should be the <em>last</em>\nin the list configured. A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> throwing an exception during commit will automatically\ncause the remaining transaction managers to roll back instead of committing.",
      "translation": "配置的实例将按照给定顺序启动事务，并以<em>相反</em>的顺序提交或回滚。这意味着最有可能破坏事务的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>应该是配置列表中的<em>最后一个</em>。如果在提交过程中抛出异常的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>将自动导致其余事务管理器回滚，而不是提交。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Instead of using <a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.transaction\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a> for attaching callbacks to transaction commit (pre commit/post\ncommit), either register a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronization.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronization</code></a> to explicitly\nfollow transaction cleanup with simplified semantics in case of exceptions.",
      "translation": "与其使用 <a href=\"ChainedTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.transaction 中的类\"><code>ChainedTransactionManager</code></a> 来为事务提交（预提交/后提交）附加回调，不如注册一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronization.html\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction.reactive 中的类或接口\"><code>TransactionSynchronization</code></a>，以便在发生异常时通过简化的语义显式地跟随事务清理过程。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
