    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html#commit(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionStatus)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\">commit</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\">PlatformTransactionManager</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html#commit(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionStatus)\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction 中的类或接口\">commit</a></code> 是接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction 中的类或接口\">PlatformTransactionManager</a></code> 中的一个方法。",
      "count": 1
