    {
      "source": "<code>transactionManagers</code> - must not be null or empty.",
      "translation": "<code>transactionManagers</code> 不能为 null 或为空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Michael Hunger, Oliver Gierke, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "Michael Hunger，Oliver Gierke，Mark Paluch",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> implementation that orchestrates transaction creation, commits and rollbacks to a\nlist of delegates. Using this implementation assumes that errors causing a transaction rollback will usually happen\nbefore the transaction completion or during the commit of the most inner <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 以协调向一组委托创建、提交和回滚事务。使用此实现假设导致事务回滚的错误通常会在最内层 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 的事务完成之前或提交期间发生。",
      "count": 1
    }
